usage: textrader [-h] [--version] [--config CONFIG] [--risk RISK]
                 {doctor,market,analyze,paper,backtest,research,llm,connector,kill-switch,ingest,web} ...

TEXTRADER X autonomous trading runtime

positional arguments:
  {doctor,market,analyze,paper,backtest,research,llm,connector,kill-switch,ingest,web}
    doctor              validate runtime/configuration
    market              read real public market data
    analyze             run one XIR decision cycle
    paper               run paper cycles
    backtest            run deterministic historical replay
    research            run auditable knowledge research/search
    llm                 manage/switch the LLM provider (mock, ollama, openai,
                        anthropic, custom)
    connector           manage external source connectors (API key or plain
                        URL)
    kill-switch         activate/resume the safety halt
    ingest              analyze a normalized/manual market JSON snapshot
    web                 start local web dashboard

options:
  -h, --help            show this help message and exit
  --version             show program's version number and exit
  --config CONFIG       trader.yaml path
  --risk RISK           risk.yaml path
usage: textrader analyze [-h] [--source {mock,binance,bitget}]
                         [--mode {paper,backtest,live}] [--decision-only]
                         [symbol]

positional arguments:
  symbol

options:
  -h, --help            show this help message and exit
  --source {mock,binance,bitget}
  --mode {paper,backtest,live}
  --decision-only       analysis only: BUY/SELL is reported but never
                        submitted
usage: textrader paper [-h] [--cycles CYCLES] [--interval INTERVAL]
                       [--source {mock,binance,bitget}] [--decision-only]
                       [symbol]

positional arguments:
  symbol

options:
  -h, --help            show this help message and exit
  --cycles CYCLES
  --interval INTERVAL
  --source {mock,binance,bitget}
  --decision-only       analysis only: BUY/SELL is reported but never
                        submitted
usage: textrader backtest [-h] [--bars BARS]

options:
  -h, --help   show this help message and exit
  --bars BARS
usage: textrader market [-h] [--interval INTERVAL] [--limit LIMIT]
                        [--source {binance,bitget}]
                        symbol

positional arguments:
  symbol

options:
  -h, --help            show this help message and exit
  --interval INTERVAL
  --limit LIMIT
  --source {binance,bitget}
                        public market-data provider
usage: textrader research [-h] [query]

positional arguments:
  query

options:
  -h, --help  show this help message and exit
usage: textrader llm [-h] {list,set,test} ...

positional arguments:
  {list,set,test}
    list           show active + available providers
    set            switch provider (persists to trader.yaml)
    test           send a 1-token probe through the provider

options:
  -h, --help       show this help message and exit
usage: textrader connector [-h] {add,list,test,remove} ...

positional arguments:
  {add,list,test,remove}
    add                 register a connector: --base-url+--api-key-env (api
                        mode) or --url (url mode)
    list                list registered connectors
    test                fetch once and report ok/error
    remove              remove a connector

options:
  -h, --help            show this help message and exit
usage: textrader kill-switch [-h] [--reason REASON] {status,on,off}

positional arguments:
  {status,on,off}

options:
  -h, --help       show this help message and exit
  --reason REASON
usage: textrader ingest [-h] input

positional arguments:
  input       JSON file containing open/high/low/close and portfolio fields

options:
  -h, --help  show this help message and exit
usage: textrader web [-h] [--host HOST] [--port PORT] [--symbol SYMBOL]

options:
  -h, --help       show this help message and exit
  --host HOST
  --port PORT
  --symbol SYMBOL
